 DisplayButtonsWithAlignRightAndTwoRows;globalGuiParms;buttons;bool;parms;msg
⍝ Presents 2x2 buttons together with a message. This one aligns the buttons to the right.
 globalGuiParms←##.APLGUI.APLGuiGlobalParms.CreateDefaults
 globalGuiParms.regKey←'MyApp\Kai1'
 globalGuiParms.icon←⎕NEW'Icon'(⊂'File'(GetFile'Misc\Sample.ico'))
 globalGuiParms.alignButtons←##.APLGUI.Enums.Align.Right
 buttons←2 2⍴'PDF' 'XML' 'JSON' 'Cancel'
 parms←##.APLGUI.Dialogs.CreateParmsForDisplayButtons
 parms.cancelButton←¯1+⍴,buttons
 msg←'Please select carefully the appropriate action you want to execute onto the selected objects:'
 bool←globalGuiParms parms ##.APLGUI.Dialogs.DisplayButtons msg buttons
 :If 0=+/bool
     ⎕←'Cancelled'
 :Else
     ⎕←'Button pressed: "',(↑(,bool)/,buttons),'"'
 :EndIf
⍝Done
